{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","n":"17","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/half_kaddish/quotes/veattah/numbers_14/17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/14/17"}}
{"text":"And now may the power of the Lord appear great, as Thou hast said."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
